<!--
  Adaptive-icon foreground for the application itself, never a launcher identity —
  DESIGN.md §9, `cover-fingerprint-pattern`.

  Material Symbols "home_repair_service", filled, on the 108dp adaptive canvas, scaled 2.5x and
  centred so its content stays inside the 66dp safe zone. It is no identity's icon, and was kept
  when the application label became `Kova`, because Android draws the application icon where no
  alias icon reaches: the biometric prompt's header on Android 15
  and later, and Settings → Apps. Left as the vault's icon, it put the vault's glyph over a music
  player the moment the fingerprint sheet appeared.
-->
